%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: invisible text. Text shown outside the media box is
% recorded in the IR and written to the page like any other run; the
% rendered page is blank, and a text extractor that drops invisible
% text reports nothing for it, which the oracle harness notes rather
% than counts against the file.
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
-200 -200 moveto (off the page) show
showpage
